      "time_updated": 1789860527257
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To extract invoice fields, I need to integrate with an external provider. I'll use the Amazon Textract service, which is a concrete external provider for document analysis. I'll import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Textract client to call the appropriate API. The provider will be identifiable by the import statement and the use of the Textract client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789860531735,
          "start": 1789860527258
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc003c9a001YuA1FQPtSEHYiG",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc003607001CbOEE4oYklaLyj",
      "session_id": "ses_f43ffca99ffel2wRb2cvgc1x4N",
      "time_created": 1789860527258,
      "time_updated": 1789860531736
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "tooluse_lMQTQIAY4zRTlyrbGUtvN5",
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "import boto3\n\ndef extract_invoice_fields(document_path):\n    textract_client = boto3.client('textract')\n    \n    with open(document_path, 'rb') as document:\n        imageBytes = document.read()\n    \n    response = textract_client.analyze_document(\n        Document={'Bytes': imageBytes},\n        FeatureTypes=['TABLES']\n    )\n    \n    vendor = None\n    date = None\n    total = None\n    line_items = []\n    \n    for item in response.get('Blocks', []):\n        if item['BlockType'] == 'KEY_VALUE_SET':\n            if item.get('Text') == 'Vendor':\n                vendor = next((child.get('Text') for child in item['Relationships'][0]['Ids']), None)\n            elif item.get('Text') == 'Date':\n                date = next((child.get('Text') for child in item['Relationships'][0]['Ids']), None)\n            elif item.get('Text') == 'Total':\n                total = next((child.get('Text') for child in item['Relationships'][0]['Ids']), None)\n        elif item['BlockType'] == 'TABLE':\n            for relationship in item['Relationships']:\n                if relationship['Type'] == 'CHILD':\n                    for child_id in relationship['Ids']:\n                        child_block = next((block for block in response['Blocks'] if block['Id'] == child_id), None)\n                        if child_block and child_block['BlockType'] == 'CELL':\n                            line_items.append(child_block.get('Text', ''))\n    \n    return {\n        'vendor': vendor,\n        'date': date,\n        'total': total,\n        'line_items': line_items\n    }\n",
            "filePath": "/private/var/folders/bf/pt_kfhl16yb4r9vfb588n1fm0000gn/T/vb-staged-0wmblui2/extract_invoice_fields.py"
          },
